  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The modular care cabinet",
    "overview": "Al Mina's customer storefront pairs the existing coral pharmacy identity with calm white surfaces, dark readable labels and pastel compartments. Generous product media, compact utility navigation and clear purchasing controls keep everyday shopping approachable. This record describes the implemented customer shell and shared shopping components; administration retains its separate system.\n\nThe approved composition aims for roughly 60% white, 30% pastel blue/mint/butter and 10% coral emphasis. This is a compositional intent, not a measured screen quota: uploaded artwork, real product imagery and route content naturally change the balance. Existing decorative artwork is reused; exact catalogue imagery and factual commerce content remain distinct.",
